# Go sources are LF everywhere. The working tree of this checkout is mostly CRLF
# and the index is LF, which is invisible until a clone lands on a different
# core.autocrlf: then the 8 LF files show up as whole-file rewrites and blame
# attributes lines to the wrong commits. Naming the line ending here settles it
# per file rather than per machine, without rewriting a single file.
*.go text eol=lf
